Given `--playbook`, a machine that declares no `artifact:` takes the named file as its target, and
bootstraps and moves it like any other run artifact.

-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-targetless/playbook.md --
---
name: fx-targetless
title: Targetless
summary: States-bearing fixture whose machine declares no artifact.
---

Preamble.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-targetless/playbook.yaml --
state: main
graph:
  only: []

states:
  main:
    initial: reviewing
    statuses:
      reviewing:
        transitions:
          - to: reviewed
            when: the review is written
      reviewed: {terminal: true}
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-targetless/only/prompt.md --
---
summary: Only step.
---

Only body.
-- fixtures/cwd/run/.keep --
-- cmd --
booping transition run/review.md reviewing --playbook fx-targetless
booping transition run/review.md reviewed --playbook fx-targetless
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
created {CWD}/run/review.md
not-started → reviewing
frontmatter: status=reviewing
reviewing → reviewed
frontmatter: status=reviewed
-- stderr --
-- expected/cwd/run/review.md --
---
status: reviewed
---
